00:28:51,866 --> 00:28:55,266
那HR就会说你这么想休息
nà HR jiù huì shuō nǐ zhè me xiǎng xiū xí
Then HR will ask you if you really want to rest.

669
00:28:55,266 --> 00:28:57,400
就不要想着多赚钱了
jiù bú yào xiǎng zhe duō zhuàn qián le
Don't think about making more money.

670
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:59,533
你这样是找不到工作的
nǐ zhè yàng shì zhǎo bú dào gōng zuò de
You won't find a job this way.

671
00:28:59,633 --> 00:29:02,666
就很讨厌他
jiù hěn tǎo yàn tā
I really hate him

672
00:29:02,666 --> 00:29:04,200
为什么要这样说
wèi shén me yào zhè yàng shuō
Why do you say that?

673
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:06,733
这样说很过分
zhè yàng shuō hěn guò fèn
That's an exaggeration.

674
00:29:06,733 --> 00:29:08,433
我觉得很不礼貌
wǒ jué de hěn bù lǐ mào
I think it's very rude

675
00:29:08,466 --> 00:29:10,466
对很多HR这样
duì hěn duō HR zhè yàng
For many HR

676
00:29:10,466 --> 00:29:11,500
他们觉得
tā men jué de
They feel

677
00:29:11,633 --> 00:29:15,466
可能因为他的公司不能达到这个要求
kě néng yīn wèi tā de gōng sī bù néng dá dào zhè ge yāo qiú
Maybe his company can't meet this requirement.

678
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:17,900
他就觉得
tā jiù jué de
He felt

679
00:29:17,900 --> 00:29:19,300
你想做这个
nǐ xiǎng zuò zhè ge
You want to do this

680
00:29:19,300 --> 00:29:20,533
你就去找别人吧
nǐ jiù qù zhǎo bié rén ba
Just go find someone else.

681
00:29:20,533 --> 00:29:21,900
别来我们这里
bié lái wǒ men zhè lǐ
Don't come here

682
00:29:22,833 --> 00:29:24,133
天呐
tiān na
Oh my god

683
00:29:24,900 --> 00:29:27,500
那的确是真的很让人生气
nà dí què shì zhēn de hěn ràng rén shēng qì
That's really infuriating.

684
00:29:27,500 --> 00:29:32,700
我之前有一个工作的面试
wǒ zhī qián yǒu yí ge gōng zuò de miàn shì
I had a job interview before

685
00:29:32,700 --> 00:29:34,233
我没有去那个工作
wǒ méi yǒu qù nà ge gōng zuò
I didn't go to that job

686
00:29:34,233 --> 00:29:35,733
他为什么让我很生气呢
tā wèi shén me ràng wǒ hěn shēng qì ne
Why does he make me angry?

687
00:29:35,733 --> 00:29:37,700
是因为我面试的时候
shì yīn wèi wǒ miàn shì de shí hou
Because when I was interviewing

688
00:29:37,700 --> 00:29:39,300
他没有问我很多就是
tā méi yǒu wèn wǒ hěn duō jiù shì
He didn't ask me much.

689
00:29:39,300 --> 00:29:42,000
关于我自己的能力的问题
guān yú wǒ zì jǐ de néng lì de wèn tí
Questions about my own abilities

690
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:43,400
他一直在问我
tā yì zhí zài wèn wǒ
He keeps asking me

691
00:29:43,500 --> 00:29:45,500
那你可以加班吗
nà nǐ kě yǐ jiā bān ma
Can you work overtime?

692
00:29:45,800 --> 00:29:48,633
我说如果有需要
wǒ shuō rú guǒ yǒu xū yào
I said if necessary

693
00:29:48,633 --> 00:29:50,533
我可以考虑加班
wǒ kě yǐ kǎo lǜ jiā bān
I can consider working overtime

694
00:29:50,633 --> 00:29:52,733
然后他说
rán hòu tā shuō
Then he said

695
00:29:52,733 --> 00:29:54,600
那如果一个同事
nà rú guǒ yí ge tóng shì
What if a colleague

696
00:29:54,600 --> 00:29:55,533
她生病了
tā shēng bìng le
She is sick

697
00:29:55,533 --> 00:29:57,500
或者她有别的事情
huò zhě tā yǒu bié de shì qing
Or she has something else going on.

698
00:29:57,500 --> 00:29:59,200
比如她去生孩子了
bǐ rú tā qù shēng hái zi le
Like, she gave birth to a child.

699
00:29:59,300 --> 00:30:01,333
你可以做他的工作吗
nǐ kě yǐ zuò tā de gōng zuò ma
Can you do his job?

700
00:30:01,466 --> 00:30:03,133
就是我突然发现
jiù shì wǒ tū rán fā xiàn
I suddenly discovered

701
00:30:03,133 --> 00:30:04,200
他好像在问我
tā hǎo xiàng zài wèn wǒ
He seemed to be asking me

702
00:30:04,200 --> 00:30:07,533
很多和这个工作没有关系的问题
hěn duō hé zhè ge gōng zuò méi yǒu guān xì de wèn tí
Many issues that have nothing to do with this job

703
00:30:07,533 --> 00:30:10,266
但是他又很想让我做很多的工作
dàn shì tā yòu hěn xiǎng ràng wǒ zuò hěn duō de gōng zuò
But he wanted me to do a lot of work.

704
00:30:10,266 --> 00:30:12,433
让我做别人的工作
ràng wǒ zuò bié rén de gōng zuò
Let me do someone else's job

705
00:30:12,433 --> 00:30:13,733
对所以我觉得
duì suǒ yǐ wǒ jué de
So I think

706
00:30:13,733 --> 00:30:16,100
这个公司很奇怪
zhè ge gōng sī hěn qí guài
This company is weird.

707
00:30:16,100 --> 00:30:18,500
所以我不要去这个公司
suǒ yǐ wǒ bú yào qù zhè ge gōng sī
So I won't go to this company.

708
00:30:18,633 --> 00:30:19,433
对
duì
right

709
00:30:20,300 --> 00:30:21,633
不去是对的
bú qù shì duì de
It's right not to go

710
00:30:21,633 --> 00:30:22,500
如果去了
rú guǒ qù le
If you go

711
00:30:22,500 --> 00:30:24,466
你就会变得很累
nǐ jiù huì biàn de hěn lèi
You will become very tired

712
00:30:24,466 --> 00:30:25,833
很累很累
hěn lèi hěn lèi
Very tired

713
00:30:27,466 --> 00:30:28,733
同意同意
tóng yì tóng yì
Agree Agree

